WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.200 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.000 --> 01:42.840
STARS SHINE UPON AUSPICIOUS CLOUDS

01:42.920 --> 01:46.720
Your Zhuyu Estate
had the finest scenery in the capital.

01:46.800 --> 01:48.760
But you tore it down to help the needy.

01:49.280 --> 01:52.560
My garden is nothing special,
yet you're praising it to the skies.

01:54.760 --> 01:56.320
How strange.

01:57.080 --> 01:58.600
I begged you to stay
at yesterday's banquet,

01:58.680 --> 02:00.360
but you wouldn't hear of it.

02:00.440 --> 02:02.280
Now you want a tour of the garden?

02:02.840 --> 02:07.080
Can this compare to the natural beauty of
your Mount Yaowang?

02:08.199 --> 02:11.480
Who wants to drink
with a bunch of obnoxious men?

02:11.560 --> 02:13.760
They're fat, bloated, and hard to look at.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.680
So vulgar.

02:16.680 --> 02:18.360
Only the most favored officials
get invited

02:18.440 --> 02:20.040
to the Crown Prince's Residence.

02:22.400 --> 02:25.360
And you, my dear sister,
have won the Crown Prince's favor.

02:27.200 --> 02:29.480
Half the world is dying of envy.
And you're still not content?

02:31.360 --> 02:33.000
Enough about that.

02:33.840 --> 02:37.160
I heard the Crown Prince brought
rare stones from the south for his garden.

02:38.360 --> 02:40.440
Every turn reveals something beautiful.

02:41.240 --> 02:43.440
Your Highness, show me around some more.

02:43.960 --> 02:44.880
I want to see it all.

02:47.880 --> 02:50.920
All right, all right.
You always get your way.

02:53.040 --> 02:54.120
Watch your step, Rao.

02:57.560 --> 02:58.600
Look.

03:32.360 --> 03:33.480
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING FILMING

03:33.560 --> 03:34.720
FILMED UNDER PROFESSIONAL SUPERVISION
WITHOUT HARM

03:42.440 --> 03:44.320
-The Crown Prince hit the target!
-Bravo!

03:44.400 --> 03:46.280
-Your Highness is mighty!
-Indeed!

03:46.360 --> 03:48.000
-Your Highness is mighty!
-Excellent shot.

03:48.080 --> 03:49.880
The Crown Prince is in fine form today.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.640
We've barely entered the woods,
and he's already made a kill.

03:52.240 --> 03:54.280
Everyone knows
you're a master archer, Lord Lu.

03:55.160 --> 03:57.000
I'm showing off before an expert.

03:57.080 --> 03:58.320
How embarrassing.

03:58.400 --> 04:00.760
Your Highness is so busy with
state affairs, you rarely get to hunt.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.680
Otherwise, the rest of us
would never get a chance to shine.

04:03.280 --> 04:05.120
Lord Lu, you've always been so aloof.

04:05.640 --> 04:07.440
Whenever we brothers
invite you to a banquet,

04:07.520 --> 04:09.320
you make every excuse not to come.

04:09.920 --> 04:12.280
So you do know
how to flatter my imperial brother.

04:13.640 --> 04:16.200
I meant every word. How is that flattery?

04:17.360 --> 04:20.560
Your Highness, I hear
a great white tiger roams these woods.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.960
If you capture it alive
and present it to His Majesty,

04:24.040 --> 04:25.000
he'll be delighted.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.280
Really? A great white tiger?

04:27.640 --> 04:30.920
Hunters say it's often spotted
roaming the ridge ahead.

04:32.120 --> 04:32.960
I'll lead the way, Your Highness.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.920
Quick! Lead us there!

04:36.880 --> 04:38.760
I thought the Lu family
was above all this.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.320
But the moment
my brother became Crown Prince,

04:41.400 --> 04:43.160
they couldn't wait to cozy up to him.

04:43.760 --> 04:44.640
Come on.

04:45.240 --> 04:47.960
Let's capture that white tiger first.
That'll be a great achievement.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.120
Brothers, wait for me!

04:55.480 --> 04:57.440
SPRING'S EMBRACE

04:57.520 --> 04:58.480
Anything unusual?

04:58.560 --> 04:59.920
-Everything's normal.
-Good.

05:05.280 --> 05:07.120
The Crown Prince
thinks very highly of you, Shu.

05:08.280 --> 05:10.200
When he acts inappropriately,

05:10.720 --> 05:13.680
you should try to set him straight.

05:13.760 --> 05:14.760
Set him straight?

05:16.520 --> 05:18.120
He holds the royal power.

05:18.200 --> 05:20.040
Who am I to tell him no?

05:20.640 --> 05:24.040
Sometimes, Rao,
your innocence is almost adorable.

05:30.840 --> 05:32.680
SPRING'S EMBRACE

05:41.920 --> 05:43.880
What's inside that courtyard?

05:44.640 --> 05:47.440
Just a storeroom. Nothing worth seeing.

05:48.120 --> 05:50.040
Let's go feed
the golden carp in the eastern lake.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.880
You must be hiding
something precious in there.

05:54.400 --> 05:57.320
If Your Highness won't let me see it,
that only makes me more curious.

06:19.760 --> 06:22.320
It seems the Lady of Wu'an

06:24.200 --> 06:25.360
didn't come for a tour today.

06:26.640 --> 06:29.000
My younger sister, Hongxian,
was abducted for no reason.

06:29.520 --> 06:31.240
Someone saw
she's in the Crown Prince's Residence.

06:32.320 --> 06:34.160
Hongxian is just a naive country girl.

06:34.240 --> 06:36.960
Please, Your Highness,
show her mercy and let her go home.

06:38.080 --> 06:40.720
I'll owe you a favor,
and I'll repay it someday.

06:46.680 --> 06:48.880
Who gave you permission
to mistreat our guest?

06:48.960 --> 06:50.000
Leave us.

06:55.840 --> 06:58.840
There's someone
I'd like you to meet, dear sister.

07:10.520 --> 07:11.680
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

07:23.840 --> 07:26.360
Your Ladyship, do you remember this man?

07:27.560 --> 07:29.720
He's Jin Chang,
the head stewardess of my Wei family.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.680
He's also the man
who got you out of prison.

07:37.000 --> 07:40.040
Leave us.
I'd like a word alone with Her Ladyship.

07:52.720 --> 07:55.960
Forced to kill someone.
Thrown into prison.

08:04.400 --> 08:07.600
Tortured so brutally
that death seemed kinder.

08:07.680 --> 08:09.000
Just to stay alive,

08:09.080 --> 08:12.320
you had to grovel before
the vilest guards and prisoners.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.200
-How humiliating that must have been.
-Have some water.

08:15.280 --> 08:16.280
Drink it!

08:17.040 --> 08:18.520
In a place like that,

08:18.600 --> 08:21.640
-Drink!
-a woman on death row…

08:21.720 --> 08:23.480
-Just trying to survive…
-Good!

08:23.560 --> 08:26.160
-How much humiliation must she endure?
-Drink!

08:27.040 --> 08:28.760
I can only imagine.

08:30.480 --> 08:31.520
But

08:33.159 --> 08:34.600
would Lord Lu understand?

08:35.400 --> 08:37.960
What about those refugees who worship you?

08:38.039 --> 08:40.799
Could they accept that
the noble, untouchable Lady of Wu'an

08:40.880 --> 08:43.679
was once a lowly death-row inmate?

08:46.040 --> 08:47.000
Rao,

08:47.920 --> 08:49.080
rumors can destroy a person.

08:49.680 --> 08:51.960
-Are you threatening me?
-I'm giving you a friendly warning.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.640
Rao,

08:57.160 --> 08:59.680
every step you've taken
has been dangerous.

08:59.760 --> 09:01.640
You fought so hard to get where you are.

09:02.240 --> 09:05.360
Now you have a title and your own lands,
not to mention everyone's respect.

09:07.120 --> 09:09.040
Why can't you appreciate what you have?

09:09.640 --> 09:11.360
Why did you have to stick your nose in?

09:19.200 --> 09:20.400
Hongxian is my adoptive mother's daughter.

09:21.840 --> 09:24.480
Rao! That's my sister's voice!

09:24.560 --> 09:26.040
I can stay out of everything else.

09:26.960 --> 09:29.360
Just give her back to me, please.

09:34.360 --> 09:35.400
Rao!

09:35.480 --> 09:40.040
Save me! Don't leave me! Rao! Rao!

09:41.240 --> 09:42.240
Are you begging me?

09:47.600 --> 09:48.600
Yes.

09:52.400 --> 09:53.400
I'm begging you.

09:53.480 --> 09:55.880
Wei Rao,
you were born into the Wei family.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.640
Noble blood runs through your veins.

09:57.720 --> 09:59.480
How could you have
a sister from the slums?

10:00.320 --> 10:01.680
Someone so lowly…

10:01.760 --> 10:03.080
-has nothing to do with you!
-But…

10:03.160 --> 10:05.000
Don't you understand?

10:05.560 --> 10:07.400
Who would claim kinship
with a servant's child?

10:08.240 --> 10:10.400
If you want to be true nobility,

10:10.480 --> 10:14.480
you must cut ties
with those filthy, lowborn people.

10:20.960 --> 10:22.240
Have you given up yet?

10:22.840 --> 10:25.920
Be good and do as you're told. Let's go.

10:30.200 --> 10:31.280
Stop!

10:32.360 --> 10:33.520
Rao!

10:35.080 --> 10:37.960
Rao! Rao!

10:39.040 --> 10:40.640
Come here, you!

10:45.600 --> 10:47.360
SPRING'S EMBRACE

10:51.720 --> 10:53.400
-Hongxian!
-Wei Rao,

10:53.480 --> 10:54.800
this is the Crown Prince's Residence!

10:54.880 --> 10:56.400
You can't just barge in!

11:04.640 --> 11:07.200
Rao, go home.

11:08.200 --> 11:10.600
Bury your past forever.

11:10.680 --> 11:15.000
Stay away from those lowborn people.
You're only lowering yourself.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.400
Come here.

11:30.720 --> 11:34.760
‎SPRING'S EMBRACE

12:03.600 --> 12:05.680
Learn from the Lady of Wu'an.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.720
She knows when to give in.

12:20.080 --> 12:21.880
I'm trying to save Wei Rao.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.240
And I'm trying to save you, too.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.680
If you keep being stubborn,

12:27.280 --> 12:29.160
you'll end up joining the dead.

12:35.160 --> 12:36.960
Clean her up.

12:37.040 --> 12:38.480
Then send her to serve His Highness.

12:39.480 --> 12:40.400
Yes, Your Highness.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.640
Get up!

13:05.560 --> 13:07.640
My Lord,
this courtyard's been abandoned for years.

13:07.720 --> 13:09.600
No one's lived here.
Why would Her Ladyship come here?

13:12.480 --> 13:13.320
Wait outside.

13:14.800 --> 13:15.640
Yes, My Lord.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.000
Wei Rao.

13:42.800 --> 13:46.440
She could've done me a simple favor
and given Hongxian back.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.080
But she didn't.

13:51.560 --> 13:53.760
Even with my title as Lady of Wu'an,

13:55.080 --> 13:57.200
those royal nobles still see me

13:58.800 --> 14:00.600
as beneath them.

14:10.240 --> 14:11.640
They look down on me.

14:12.920 --> 14:14.680
Deep down, they despise me.

14:18.760 --> 14:20.080
-Wei Rao.
-Tell me…

14:25.240 --> 14:27.760
Why did fate bring me

14:30.280 --> 14:31.680
to a place like this?

14:33.120 --> 14:34.960
The rich feast on the finest grains,

14:35.840 --> 14:37.760
while the poor survive
on scraps and husks.

14:38.560 --> 14:40.720
My stomach isn't like theirs.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.640
I can't stomach their rich food and wine.

14:45.920 --> 14:48.040
My eyes aren't like theirs, either.

14:48.800 --> 14:50.760
When I see dancers
entertaining the nobles,

14:52.440 --> 14:55.480
all I can think about is
how little their families sold them for,

14:56.080 --> 14:58.360
and whether
their children are going hungry.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.520
And my hands…

15:07.080 --> 15:07.920
Look.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.080
Feel them.

15:16.160 --> 15:18.840
My hands aren't like theirs, either.
They're different.

15:19.760 --> 15:21.120
No matter
how many expensive treatments I use,

15:21.720 --> 15:23.200
they're still rough.

15:25.600 --> 15:26.840
Why?

15:29.240 --> 15:31.120
Why did fate make me this way?

15:33.080 --> 15:35.600
I'm neither a commoner nor a noble.

15:36.160 --> 15:38.800
When I sit among them, I never fit in!

15:38.880 --> 15:41.120
They call me crazy! They call me a fool!

15:41.640 --> 15:44.280
But I could've lived just
as comfortably and carefree as they do.

15:44.360 --> 15:47.160
Why can't I? Why?

15:48.720 --> 15:52.280
Why can't I? Why can't I?!

16:02.000 --> 16:03.040
You're different.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.920
Then be different.

16:11.800 --> 16:14.240
Now, come with me.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.040
Do you see?

17:40.280 --> 17:41.400
That was me.

17:43.840 --> 17:45.040
I was her.

17:46.080 --> 17:47.240
All of this…

17:48.600 --> 17:49.480
I already know.

17:49.560 --> 17:51.640
But you've never seen it
with your own eyes.

17:53.400 --> 17:55.240
If I were still dumping chamber pots,

17:55.320 --> 17:57.440
and you rode past on horseback,

17:59.120 --> 18:01.240
would you even spare me a glance?

18:04.040 --> 18:05.200
You wouldn't.

18:06.840 --> 18:08.120
Neither would Qi Zhongkai.

18:11.040 --> 18:13.040
Even the stray dogs

18:14.120 --> 18:15.760
would run away from me.

18:20.600 --> 18:22.400
Who could ever love that version of me?

18:23.880 --> 18:25.880
What if I were just an ordinary,

18:25.960 --> 18:28.600
ugly, boring man?

18:29.560 --> 18:31.160
Not the heir to a duke's estate.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.040
Not the man you see before you.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.680
Would you still marry me?

18:45.400 --> 18:47.080
When we first met,

18:48.520 --> 18:50.240
I was the heir to the Duke of Ying.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.680
And you were the substitute bride.

18:53.360 --> 18:55.840
I can't go back and give you an answer.

18:56.760 --> 18:58.280
The woman I see

18:59.800 --> 19:03.480
is the one standing here,
right in front of me.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.520
Your past may have been painful.

19:07.600 --> 19:09.920
Then let it be painful.So what?

19:11.840 --> 19:13.480
I should be thanking her.

19:16.920 --> 19:17.760
For what?

19:18.680 --> 19:20.960
For her strength. For never giving up.

19:21.480 --> 19:23.400
For her ambition.
For never once bowing her head.

19:25.360 --> 19:27.840
Step by step,

19:30.320 --> 19:32.120
she made her way to me.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.960
That girl named A-Chou…

19:38.680 --> 19:40.280
How remarkable she must have been.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.840
But Lu Zhuo…

20:05.320 --> 20:06.720
I don't know what to do anymore.

20:07.480 --> 20:09.840
They're pressuring me. They won't stop.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.760
Who?

20:12.880 --> 20:14.080
Who's threatening you?

20:15.160 --> 20:17.040
My shameful past…

20:17.920 --> 20:20.200
I don't want anyone to know.

20:20.280 --> 20:22.320
I can't bear those judgmental looks again.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.360
But the Crown Prince…

20:24.640 --> 20:27.000
He's gotten hold of Jin Chang,
the Wei family's steward.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.840
He's the one who got me out of prison.

20:30.920 --> 20:33.160
He knows every humiliating, awful thing
I went through.

20:34.840 --> 20:36.280
I can't take it anymore.

20:37.520 --> 20:38.680
Please help me.

20:39.480 --> 20:41.040
Help me get rid of this threat, please.

20:42.320 --> 20:43.160
Where is he?

20:46.400 --> 20:47.880
The Crown Prince has a private prison

20:48.800 --> 20:50.320
on the east side of the city.

20:51.800 --> 20:53.160
Jin Chang is being held there.

20:54.040 --> 20:55.400
If he gets out and starts talking…

20:55.480 --> 20:56.560
-Then I'll…
-He won't.

20:58.840 --> 21:00.320
You'll never see him again.

21:02.760 --> 21:03.880
I promise.

21:06.680 --> 21:07.520
Really?

21:22.480 --> 21:23.400
Here.

21:23.480 --> 21:24.840
They call it
the Crown Prince's private prison,

21:24.920 --> 21:26.280
but it's really just a separate estate.

21:26.800 --> 21:29.720
Our scouts say he keeps
thieves and runaway servants there,

21:29.800 --> 21:30.960
caught during his patrols.

21:31.840 --> 21:32.960
That's all.

21:34.320 --> 21:36.680
The Crown Prince is known
for his kindness and humility.

21:37.280 --> 21:40.040
He has an excellent reputation at court.
But he's still royalty.

21:40.120 --> 21:41.840
Who knows
what he's really like in private?

21:41.920 --> 21:45.240
Are those prisoners
truly criminals or innocent people?

21:45.320 --> 21:47.240
Who would dare question him?

21:48.400 --> 21:51.080
The man you're looking for…
Is he really inside that estate?

21:55.800 --> 22:00.880
NOBLE AND BRIGHT

22:01.600 --> 22:02.680
Maybe.

22:03.200 --> 22:05.120
You never make a move unless you're sure.

22:05.720 --> 22:07.680
Why are you being so evasive?

22:07.760 --> 22:08.600
Is something wrong?

22:09.480 --> 22:10.720
Stop asking so many questions.

22:11.920 --> 22:13.040
You'll find out soon enough.

22:14.880 --> 22:17.600
Don't you think Wei Rao has changed a lot?

22:20.800 --> 22:21.800
I trust her.

22:23.840 --> 22:26.200
-Why are we here?
-No idea.

22:26.280 --> 22:28.800
-Do you know what is it about?
-Let's hear it.

22:29.960 --> 22:31.920
So many people train here,

22:32.840 --> 22:34.680
but I chose only you.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.480
Do you know why?

22:36.560 --> 22:38.280
No idea.

22:38.360 --> 22:39.400
All of you

22:40.120 --> 22:43.000
fled here from the northwestern frontier.

22:44.080 --> 22:45.680
You're fighters by nature.

22:46.280 --> 22:47.200
Some of you

22:48.240 --> 22:49.560
were attacked by raiders,

22:50.200 --> 22:52.400
fought them to the death,

22:52.480 --> 22:53.960
and fled after your homes
were burned down.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.680
Others

22:57.080 --> 22:59.720
had their land stolen
by powerful landlords,

23:01.320 --> 23:04.800
killed their enemies, and had to flee.

23:06.200 --> 23:07.040
Aman.

23:13.120 --> 23:14.520
That's a lot of money!

23:15.840 --> 23:17.400
His Majesty has issued a secret decree.

23:18.080 --> 23:19.480
He needs you to carry it out.

23:20.440 --> 23:23.640
Succeed,
and you'll all be richly rewarded.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.240
All that money?

23:26.840 --> 23:28.040
-Really? That good?
-But if you fail,

23:28.680 --> 23:30.800
you'll lose your heads.

23:35.320 --> 23:36.280
Get lost!

23:37.600 --> 23:40.280
Your Ladyship,
I crawled out of a pile of corpses.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.320
I was once so hungry I couldn't walk.

23:42.400 --> 23:43.920
I could even cut flesh
from my own thigh for food.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.080
Not one of
those rich officials in the capital

23:45.160 --> 23:46.840
ever gave me so much as a sip of water.

23:47.640 --> 23:49.600
You were the one who saved my life.

23:50.680 --> 23:52.920
We don't answer to any emperor.
We answer only to you.

23:53.520 --> 23:54.920
Whatever you say, we'll do it.

23:55.000 --> 23:56.120
-That's right!
-Yes, Your Ladyship!

23:56.200 --> 23:57.080
-We follow you!
-Your orders are ours!

23:57.160 --> 23:58.840
-We're with you, Your Ladyship!
-Your Ladyship!

23:58.920 --> 23:59.960
We follow you!

24:00.600 --> 24:01.440
What's your name?

24:02.040 --> 24:04.160
I don't have one. They call me Xiao.

24:05.120 --> 24:07.560
Your Ladyship,
let me bring a few more men.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.560
They are the same as me.
We lost everything,

24:10.280 --> 24:11.560
killed the governor's
entire family, and fled.

24:12.880 --> 24:14.200
Each of them can take on ten men.

24:14.280 --> 24:16.480
-They're all fierce fighters.
-Good!

24:17.120 --> 24:19.520
Xiao, I'll remember you.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.600
Listen up, everyone!

24:24.320 --> 24:27.040
Under my command,
you'll be rewarded for your achievements.

24:27.840 --> 24:31.000
The more you accomplish,
the greater your reward!

24:32.000 --> 24:33.760
And if any of you are captured alive…

24:33.840 --> 24:35.480
They'll only take us dead.

24:37.920 --> 24:39.560
If anyone dares betray our benefactor,

24:40.080 --> 24:42.120
I'll carve them up alive, piece by piece!

24:45.720 --> 24:48.040
We obey your orders, Your Ladyship!

25:05.200 --> 25:06.840
Will you report this to Lady Li?

25:07.560 --> 25:08.760
Because if you do,

25:11.000 --> 25:12.120
you'll be betraying me.

25:16.280 --> 25:18.440
When I left the palace, Lady Li told me

25:19.240 --> 25:20.800
that my life is tied to yours.

25:20.880 --> 25:23.760
I answer only to you now,
not to anyone in the palace.

25:43.640 --> 25:46.360
ZHUYU ESTATE

26:00.120 --> 26:02.200
Your Ladyship, it's past the Xu hour.

26:06.640 --> 26:07.600
There's no rush.

26:14.160 --> 26:16.720
It's almost the Hai hour.
When are we making our move?

26:18.280 --> 26:19.160
Wei Rao isn't here yet.

26:19.760 --> 26:21.480
She's a pampered noblewoman.

26:21.560 --> 26:23.320
Why wait for her when
there's fighting to be done?

26:24.240 --> 26:25.320
Why don't we make it a contest?

26:25.400 --> 26:26.880
First one to find Jin Chang wins.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.040
-I'm worried…
-You're getting soft.

26:30.120 --> 26:32.440
It's just a small operation,
and you're already having second thoughts?

26:35.000 --> 26:37.640
-I'm worried she won't show up at all.
-Why are you being so secretive?

26:37.720 --> 26:39.240
Can't you just spit it out?

26:39.760 --> 26:42.240
Enough with the riddles.
You're getting on my nerves.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.080
Her Ladyship left
the estate with some men.

26:51.160 --> 26:53.160
She shook off everyone tailing her.
We don't know where she went.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.240
I knew it.

26:56.960 --> 26:59.000
Qi Zhongkai. Move in. Now.

27:01.960 --> 27:03.000
Move!

27:19.880 --> 27:22.040
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

27:22.120 --> 27:24.000
-Over here!
-Your Highness, come here!

27:24.080 --> 27:25.040
Your Highness!

27:32.840 --> 27:33.800
-Hurry!
-Hurry!

27:41.560 --> 27:43.720
Talk. Where are the prisoners?

27:48.920 --> 27:50.720
My Lord,
looks like everything's going smoothly.

27:52.040 --> 27:52.960
Let's go.

27:57.160 --> 27:58.520
Your Highness!

27:59.920 --> 28:01.280
What are you doing here?

28:01.360 --> 28:04.320
Your Highness, there's trouble.
The estate on the east side is on fire.

28:04.400 --> 28:06.400
Intruders slipped in during the chaos.

28:08.240 --> 28:09.120
Everyone, out.

28:11.520 --> 28:13.200
They let all the prisoners escape.

28:13.280 --> 28:15.320
Earlier, some foolish clerk
at the Court of Justice

28:15.400 --> 28:17.040
accepted a petition
from those troublemakers,

28:17.120 --> 28:18.920
claiming young women
vanished without cause

28:19.000 --> 28:20.400
The Commandant of Justice
had those rebels arrested

28:20.480 --> 28:21.920
and locked up at the estate.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.040
They hadn't been executed yet.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.320
Take half the men from the residence.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.800
-Go capture them immediately.
-Yes, Your Highness.

28:27.400 --> 28:31.360
And remember, keep it quiet.
Leave no survivors.

28:33.640 --> 28:35.160
Send word to the Northern Army, too.

28:36.360 --> 28:38.160
There'll be some unrest
in the city tonight.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.680
Tell them to stay out of it.

28:40.760 --> 28:42.320
-Go.
-Yes, Your Highness.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.520
Your Highness.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.960
Where's that girl I had my eye on?

28:50.160 --> 28:51.320
The one selling flatbread.

28:51.400 --> 28:53.400
Right, right! I'll see to it at once.

28:53.480 --> 28:55.120
-Quick! Go!
-I'll send her in.

29:00.960 --> 29:03.440
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

29:12.320 --> 29:14.520
Didn't they just leave? Why are they back?

29:25.520 --> 29:28.200
Secure the main gate,
rear gate, and both side gates.

29:28.840 --> 29:30.400
No one gets in or out.

29:39.480 --> 29:41.240
I scouted the place
thoroughly during the day.

29:41.320 --> 29:43.000
Only one narrow alley from the rear gate
leads to the inner courtyard.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.920
There's a guard every seven paces.
Security is tight.

29:46.000 --> 29:48.440
This is a restricted area!
Who dares trespass?

30:08.640 --> 30:09.520
JINGXING PAVILLION

30:25.960 --> 30:27.000
Kill them! Kill them!

30:33.680 --> 30:35.360
I… I don't work for the Crown Prince…

30:35.440 --> 30:37.920
Please spare me! Have mercy…

31:21.160 --> 31:24.000
You think you can fight back?
Stop struggling.

31:24.080 --> 31:26.680
I'll have some fun with you.
You think you can…

31:32.400 --> 31:33.440
Who's there?

32:26.000 --> 32:26.840
Your Ladyship.

32:26.920 --> 32:28.800
What about the women
locked up in the back courtyard?

32:29.520 --> 32:30.360
Free them all.

32:56.600 --> 32:58.680
Don't be afraid. I'm here to rescue you.

33:00.560 --> 33:01.760
-Come on!
-Let's go!

33:01.840 --> 33:02.760
-Hurry!
-Move!

33:14.160 --> 33:15.240
Come.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.920
Someone will meet you
at the end of this alley.

33:21.520 --> 33:24.200
Whatever happens, don't look back.
Just keep running.

33:24.280 --> 33:26.960
-Thank you, sir!
-Thank you!

33:27.040 --> 33:27.880
Go, quickly!

33:28.480 --> 33:30.160
Once the job is done, don't hesitate.

33:30.680 --> 33:32.320
Avoid Xiyin Street.
It's full of government offices.

33:32.920 --> 33:36.000
Hide in Jiuquan Alley,
Guangbu Ward, or Jingji Ward.

33:36.080 --> 33:38.520
Those areas are crowded
with refugees and full of winding streets.

33:38.600 --> 33:40.160
It'll be nearly impossible
to track you down.

33:40.760 --> 33:41.640
Go!

33:44.960 --> 33:45.840
There are intruders
in the Crown Prince's Residence!

33:45.920 --> 33:48.320
Alert the Northern Army!
Catch those intruders!

33:49.240 --> 33:50.280
Let's go.

33:51.120 --> 33:52.000
‎Rao.

33:52.600 --> 33:54.200
Her Ladyship said to spread out.

33:54.280 --> 33:55.720
We can't waste any time.

34:22.679 --> 34:23.320
UPHOLD VIRTUE AND HONOR TRADITION

34:23.400 --> 34:24.960
Your Highness, forgive my late arrival.

34:25.560 --> 34:27.159
I heard His Highness was injured.
How is he?

34:28.120 --> 34:29.120
His Highness…

34:32.639 --> 34:33.800
How is His Highness?

34:33.880 --> 34:36.880
Your Highness,
His Highness was only shaken up.

34:36.960 --> 34:38.719
-He's not seriously hurt.
-I'll go see him.

34:39.840 --> 34:43.000
Your Highness, His Highness
has taken his medicine and gone to bed.

34:43.080 --> 34:44.320
He's ordered that no one disturb him.

34:45.040 --> 34:47.440
General Li. His Highness orders you
to search the entire city.

34:47.520 --> 34:49.360
You must capture
those intruders before dawn.

34:50.080 --> 34:50.920
Understood.

34:51.679 --> 34:54.600
It was her. It had to be her!

34:55.480 --> 34:57.160
Anyone bold enough
to storm the Crown Prince's Residence

34:57.240 --> 34:59.360
must be a ruthless criminal.

35:00.000 --> 35:01.040
How would Your Highness know such people?

35:02.800 --> 35:04.920
The leader has a wound on the chest.

35:05.000 --> 35:07.200
Take your men
and search every nearby residence.

35:07.280 --> 35:10.000
Question anyone suspicious,
regardless of rank.

35:10.080 --> 35:11.440
Let no one escape.

35:12.280 --> 35:14.400
-But…
-The Crown Prince is heir to the throne.

35:14.480 --> 35:16.640
An attack on his residence
threatens the throne itself

35:16.720 --> 35:18.000
and defies His Majesty's authority.

35:18.600 --> 35:21.600
I've ordered you to find those criminals.
Are you defying my orders?

35:22.440 --> 35:23.520
Yes, Your Highness.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.320
Move out!

35:29.960 --> 35:31.520
Hurry! Move.

35:36.680 --> 35:39.720
I thought His Highness was only shaken up.
What's going on?

35:39.800 --> 35:42.640
The imperial physicians are treating him.
Please don't worry, Your Highness.

35:50.560 --> 35:52.560
What kind of injury is so serious

35:53.360 --> 35:55.240
that even I, his own wife,

35:56.080 --> 35:57.600
can't be told?

35:58.560 --> 36:00.240
Hurry!

36:00.320 --> 36:01.360
Hurry! Hurry!

36:13.200 --> 36:15.280
Search every street thoroughly!

36:15.360 --> 36:17.080
Don't let anyone suspicious get away!

36:17.680 --> 36:19.200
You men in the back, keep up!

36:40.040 --> 36:41.040
You…

36:42.280 --> 36:43.840
What am I supposed to do with you?

36:54.600 --> 36:57.480
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

36:58.520 --> 37:00.360
General, this is the Duke's residence.
Are we searching it too?

37:01.840 --> 37:03.600
-Knock on the door.
-Move!

37:09.040 --> 37:10.240
‎Search under orders!

37:12.000 --> 37:12.840
You…

37:19.200 --> 37:22.040
SONGYUE HALL

37:27.800 --> 37:29.840
SHIZHAI

37:32.520 --> 37:34.560
Who dares barge into the Duke's Residence?

37:35.160 --> 37:37.960
At midnight tonight, intruders attacked
the Crown Prince's Residence.

37:38.040 --> 37:39.280
By order of the Crown Prince,

37:39.360 --> 37:41.480
I'm searching
the entire city for the culprits.

37:42.000 --> 37:43.280
Please inform Lord Lu of my arrival.

37:45.320 --> 37:46.520
Wait here.

37:49.680 --> 37:51.880
My Lord, the Northern Army is here.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.960
They say the Crown Prince's Residence
was attacked and want to search.

38:12.080 --> 38:13.080
How dare you!

38:18.440 --> 38:20.280
I'm Li Wei,
a captain in the Northern Army.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.440
I'm here to search
on the Crown Prince's orders.

38:23.200 --> 38:26.000
Lord Lu,
please come out and speak with me.

38:34.280 --> 38:35.120
I heard you.

38:36.440 --> 38:39.240
A handful of thieves
broke into the Crown Prince's Residence?

38:39.760 --> 38:41.880
You men are utterly incompetent.

38:42.600 --> 38:45.040
What? And now
you want to search my residence?

38:46.040 --> 38:49.600
Do you think my men
are just as useless as yours?

38:51.920 --> 38:52.800
I wouldn't dare.

38:53.320 --> 38:54.600
I'm only following orders
to search the premises.

38:55.200 --> 38:57.680
The thieves may have slipped in disguised.
We're just taking precautions.

38:59.040 --> 39:01.360
I apologize for the intrusion.
Please forgive us, Lord Lu.

39:02.160 --> 39:04.160
Please allow us to conduct the search.

39:04.240 --> 39:05.520
Absolutely not.

39:06.480 --> 39:08.800
-Lord Lu.
-There's no one in my room.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.400
You may leave.

39:11.040 --> 39:14.240
I'm merely following orders.
If Lord Lu insists on stopping us,

39:14.840 --> 39:17.760
perhaps there's something inside
you don't want us to see.

39:18.920 --> 39:19.840
What's all that noise?

39:21.520 --> 39:22.360
Stop!

39:24.240 --> 39:25.520
Think carefully before you act.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.800
I'm afraid you don't have the nerve

39:29.000 --> 39:30.160
to face who's inside.

39:31.400 --> 39:34.320
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai. Keep an eye on him.

39:49.080 --> 39:52.200
The leader has a chest wound.
One look will confirm it.

39:56.640 --> 39:58.720
How dare you!
Who said you could come any closer?

39:59.800 --> 40:01.400
Get over there and kneel when you speak!

40:07.760 --> 40:10.000
Who do you think you are?
How dare you lift my bed curtains?

40:10.600 --> 40:12.120
Forgive me, Your Ladyship!
I didn't recognize you!

40:13.400 --> 40:14.440
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

40:14.960 --> 40:17.240
You've got some nerve!
What exactly are you looking for?

40:17.840 --> 40:20.680
You want to inspect my body?
Go ahead, inspect me!

40:22.320 --> 40:24.000
You're hardly dressed properly.
Go back inside.

40:24.080 --> 40:26.560
I won't! Didn't he want to search my bed?

40:26.640 --> 40:29.360
Go on! There's a thief hiding in it!
Hurry up and search!

40:29.440 --> 40:32.520
Open those eyes of yours
and take a good, hard look!

40:32.600 --> 40:34.320
I didn't know Your Ladyship was here.
I was only…

40:34.400 --> 40:35.480
You're a captain in the Northern Army!

40:35.560 --> 40:38.120
Instead of catching thieves,
you sneak into women's private quarters

40:38.200 --> 40:39.440
and demand they undress for inspection?

40:40.040 --> 40:43.000
Have you no shame?
You shameless, filthy creep!

40:44.040 --> 40:45.400
Go on. Search!

40:46.000 --> 40:47.040
Find a thief,
and I'll see you're rewarded.

40:47.120 --> 40:49.440
Find nothing, and I'll charge you
with abusing your authority!

40:49.520 --> 40:51.520
I'll make sure
you lose your rank and your job!

40:52.200 --> 40:54.000
Had enough? Now get out!

40:57.400 --> 41:00.000
He's useless in battle,
but he sure knows how to bully women!

41:00.080 --> 41:02.720
And he claims he's hunting thieves!
Where are they?

41:02.800 --> 41:03.920
Who told you to let him leave?

41:04.000 --> 41:05.400
-You're no better than him!
-Enough.

41:05.480 --> 41:07.400
All right, that's enough.
It's freezing out here.

41:07.480 --> 41:08.400
-You'll catch a cold.
-Sheathe your swords!

41:09.040 --> 41:10.120
Report!

41:11.960 --> 41:14.000
General. We've searched
all the other courtyards.

41:14.080 --> 41:15.160
There's no sign of the intruders.

41:15.240 --> 41:16.600
You worthless scoundrel!

41:16.680 --> 41:18.560
Tomorrow, I'll send people
to the Marquis of Zhennan's estate

41:18.640 --> 41:19.840
to curse you out for a whole month!

41:19.920 --> 41:23.440
I'll make sure your entire family,
inside and out, is disgraced!

41:23.520 --> 41:24.560
Let's go!

41:55.200 --> 41:56.560
-How is she?
-My Lord,

41:57.160 --> 41:59.760
the wound is deep and narrow.

42:00.320 --> 42:01.720
It may not heal easily.

42:01.800 --> 42:04.880
Once she's recovered a little,
the chief physician should examine her.

42:04.960 --> 42:07.360
No. We can't call the chief physician.

42:07.440 --> 42:09.360
It's just a small wound. I'll be fine.

42:10.000 --> 42:10.920
Just change the dressing every day.

42:11.600 --> 42:13.560
I'll do everything I can.

42:32.920 --> 42:34.240
Have a carriage prepared.

42:34.320 --> 42:36.400
At daybreak,
send Her Ladyship back to Zhuyu Estate.

42:37.240 --> 42:41.000
My Lord, Her Ladyship is injured.
She should stay here and recover.

42:42.400 --> 42:43.560
You're worrying for nothing.

42:44.080 --> 42:46.600
She clearly knows better.
She does whatever she wants.

42:47.320 --> 42:48.960
She doesn't care what you think.

42:49.600 --> 42:52.920
All your concern and worry
are completely wasted on her.

42:56.160 --> 42:57.000
Heartless woman.

43:04.720 --> 43:05.800
Let go.

43:15.360 --> 43:16.200
I said, let go.

43:17.960 --> 43:18.800
Lu Zhuo.

43:24.160 --> 43:25.400
Don't you have anything to say?

43:26.640 --> 43:27.920
About the estate…

43:30.160 --> 43:31.760
Tell me! Where did you get the nerve

43:31.840 --> 43:33.360
to storm the Crown Prince's Residence
and rescue those people?

43:34.160 --> 43:35.400
And you hid it from me?

43:37.440 --> 43:38.880
Easy. That hurts.

43:40.040 --> 43:42.360
Well, I read in a military strategy book

43:42.440 --> 43:45.760
that success depends on secrecy… No, wait.

43:47.400 --> 43:48.840
Speed is everything in battle.

43:50.560 --> 43:51.520
I didn't want to keep it from you.

43:52.200 --> 43:55.160
But you have important responsibilities.
I couldn't drag you into this.

43:55.960 --> 43:58.560
I had to handle the dirty work myself.

44:00.160 --> 44:02.720
Can't you forgive me
just this once? Please?

44:04.920 --> 44:05.760
Will you change?

44:07.040 --> 44:07.880
No.

44:09.440 --> 44:11.080
But I can swear to you.

44:13.560 --> 44:15.320
This is the last time
I'll ever lie to you.

44:16.160 --> 44:18.400
-If I ever lie again, I'll…
-You'll what?

44:21.080 --> 44:22.560
Be reborn as a pig or a dog.

44:23.560 --> 44:24.520
I swear.

44:31.960 --> 44:33.120
Your wound hurts again?

44:37.000 --> 44:38.000
Are you still mad at me?

44:40.000 --> 44:41.560
The Crown Prince's Residence
is heavily guarded.

44:43.000 --> 44:44.400
If anything had gone wrong,

44:46.200 --> 44:47.320
can you really made it out alive?

44:51.480 --> 44:53.680
-Actually, I…
-You went in

44:55.240 --> 44:57.160
knowing you might never come back.

44:59.600 --> 45:00.440
Didn't you?

45:19.680 --> 45:21.280
You're nothing but a liar.

45:24.800 --> 45:26.120
I can't trust you anymore.

45:38.920 --> 45:39.920
Lu Zhuo.

45:44.200 --> 45:46.520
Your Ladyship,
Lord Lu sent me to look after you.

45:46.600 --> 45:49.080
Whatever you need, just let me know.

48:11.000 --> 48:13.680
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
